      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LARGS LEGACY (10) will be resuming over a trip that is well short of her best, but she does have some upside. A recent trial will have her ready to run a big race, so check the market moves. BLAZING RED (1) followed up a good second here by a short head, with a similar placing at Strathalbyn a fortnight ago. He meets the right sort of field and is set to go one better. MAHALER (12) was fourth in a tougher field at Morphettville-Parks 11 days ago, and that form will measure up nicely at this level. She is peaking at the right time and will be hard to hold out. PROMPT INVOICE (6) has continued to improve at the trials, and with the blinkers on for the first time from the coveted pole position, he will be ready to rumble, especially with top hoop Rochelle Milnes in the saddle. OCHRE SPIRIT (5) won a trial before failing to fire on a heavy track fresh up here 3 weeks ago. A form reversal would not be a surprise. Keep him safe.",
